<title>FRANCE: France to ship aid to Cape Verde, Sierra Leone.</title>
<headline>France to ship aid to Cape Verde, Sierra Leone.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>France will hold tenders on December 19 to ship 8,250 tonnes of maize to Cape Verde and 3,650 tonnes of soft wheat flour to Sierra Leone as food aid, national grain office ONIC said.</p>
<p>The maize and flour are for shipment between January 13 and February 1, 1997, it said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
